{"asset_key":"ep4/env_story_14301021","episode":"ep4","category":"env_story","story_id":"14301021","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1430102101:1":{"text":"아니! 접시에 분명히 아직... 어라, 왜 하나밖에 안 남았지?","source_cn":"我没有！盘子里明明还有……怎么就剩一根鸡腿了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0964473D51D9C849","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1430102102:1":{"text":"진짜로 몇 입 밖에 안 먹었는데... 망했다, 이번에는 촌장님이 정말로 내 엉덩이를 걷어찰지도 몰라!","source_cn":"我明明只吃了几口而已……完了，这次村长一定会狠狠踢我的屁股！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9D1491DAFD7D56ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1430102103:1":{"text":"잠깐, 어차피 혼날거면 남은 다리 하나까지 다 먹어치우는 편이 낫지 않나?","source_cn":"等等，既然肯定会挨训，那我为什么还要留着这根鸡腿呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E6C4F32177D6B6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格罗姆":{"text":"그롬","source":"格罗姆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}